181	    /**
182	     * The owner's membership number, formatted {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where {@code YY} is
183	     * the last two digits of the registration date year (e.g. {@code 'SMI-0007-M26'}). Derived from
184	     * the owner's own fields; {@code null} until both the customer code and registration date are set.
