215	     * the city. When the postcode is a 4-digit value within a known region range
216	     * ({@code NSW 2000-2099}, {@code VIC 3000-3099}, {@code QLD 4000-4099}) that region is returned,
217	     * disambiguating cities that share a name. Otherwise, when the postcode is absent or in no known
